<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{% block title %}Help Me Community{% endblock %}</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/style.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/custom.css') }}">
    <script src="https://js.stripe.com/v3/"></script>
    {% block stylesheets %}{% endblock %}
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg fixed-top">
    <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="{{ path('home') }}">
            <img src="{{ asset('img/fondhelpme.png') }}" alt="Logo Help Me" style="height:40px; margin-right:10px;">
            Help Me Community
        </a>
        <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
            <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-center">
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('home') }}">Accueil</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item dropdown">
                    <a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle" href="#" id="navbarDropdown" role="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
                        Nos Projets
                    </a>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu" aria-labelledby="navbarDropdown">
                        {{ render(controller('App\\Controller\\ProjectController::nav')) }}
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('home') }}#impact">Impact</a></li>
                {% if app.user %}
                    {% if is_granted('ROLE_ADMIN') %}
                        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('admin_dashboard') }}">Admin</a></li>
                    {% endif %}
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('donor_dashboard') }}">Mes dons</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('app_logout') }}">Déconnexion</a></li>
                {% else %}
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('app_register') }}">Inscription</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('app_login') }}">Connexion</a></li>
                {% endif %}
                <li class="nav-item ms-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-donate-nav" href="{{ path('donation') }}">Faire un don</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<main>
    {# <div class="container mt-3"> #}
        {% for label, messages in app.flashes %}
            {% for message in messages %}
                <div class="alert alert-{{ label }} alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
                    {{ message }}
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
    {# </div> #}
    {% block body %}{% endblock %}
</main>

<footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                    <img src="{{ asset('img/fondhelpme.png') }}" alt="Logo" style="height: 30px; margin-right: 10px; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">Help Me Community</h5>
                </div>
                <p>Association humanitaire dédiée à l'amélioration des conditions de vie des communautés vulnérables.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2 mb-4">
                <h5>Navigation</h5>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><a href="{{ path('home') }}">Accueil</a></li>
                    <li><a href="{{ path('home') }}#projects">Nos Projets</a></li>
                    <li><a href="{{ path('home') }}#about">À Propos</a></li>
                    <li><a href="{{ path('home') }}#contact">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-2 mb-4">
                <h5>Légal</h5>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><a href="{{ path('legal_notice') }}">Mentions légales</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Politique de confidentialité</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                <h5>Nous soutenir</h5>
                <p>Votre soutien change des vies. Rejoignez-nous !</p>
                <a href="{{ path('donation') }}" class="btn btn-primary-custom">Faire un don</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Help Me Community - Tous droits réservés
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.1/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
{% block javascripts %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>
